      "body": "One day, players will be able to create `Orders`.\r\n\r\nFor some sets of orders, polylines will be used for multiple geometries, such as `Route-in` and `Route-back`.  When this happens, the map will be more legible if we put the names of the geometries onto them, using a library like this:\r\nhttps://github.com/makinacorpus/Leaflet.TextPath\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1108513/192338607-195414dc-9c5e-481f-b6ef-2b3631aeca8b.png)\r\n",
